  "notes": [
    "The B receipt records integrated_lufs=-23.99 and loudness_before/after around -24, but the file measures -17.0 LUFS and #19 agrees with the measurement. Recorded rather than corrected: the asset is correct and the receipt's loudness bookkeeping is not.",
    "B's semantic_qc reports coverage 0.3125 with status DETECTED_PROBLEM, but the detector is advisory (role DETECTOR_ONLY, can_approve_quality False). The transcript is correct; the low coverage is ASR mis-recognition of Chinese technical proper nouns (Ezio/Easel, Fontpack/FFmpeg, Pinyi/ping, ENV/.env).",
    "B's display_text_sha256 covers the locked narration with blank lines removed and no trailing newline. It is NOT the raw file digest and the two are not interchangeable.",
    "The A and B narration assets are not tracked: committing provider output is a repository-policy decision the Founder has not made. Their SHA256 values are recorded in each variant receipt so any rebuild can be verified."
  ]
